00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:51.360
and something will come out that is brilliant&nbsp;
that's going in and I'll add it into the script&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:59.520
it really it really evolves and and and that&nbsp;
too is so helpful for actors when they're&nbsp;&nbsp;

