00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:24.800
and it's gonna be welcome what techniques do you&nbsp;
use to strengthen your characters the techniques I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:33.440
use to strengthen characters are again pointing to&nbsp;
the real world and and again doing that with with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:41.040
the actors but ultimately in a script I can only&nbsp;
